0..49 Comment "//! This source shows methods that answer places."
50..53 Comment "//!"
54..112 Comment "//! A mode parameter makes a receiver answer `View[m](a)`."
113..161 Comment "//! A method body names a place in its receiver."
162..165 Comment "//!"
166..221 Comment "//! A block call lends the place at the requested mode."
222..265 Comment "//! A call without a block reads the place."
266..297 Comment "//! One body serves every mode."
298..376 Comment "//! An explicit object parameter deduces the qualifiers of its receiver in the"
377..417 Comment "//! same way [Azman-2021-deducing_this]."
